 i)) =\n        pderiv (blocksToAmbient hn (Sum.inl i)))"}],"state":"available","unresolved_names":[]},"generation_id":"sha256:eb85d3603ec7254e8723f8292d2014fbb295087c537d4a9a7c22689061a82822","id":"l:CommutingDerivations","kind":"lean-preview","omissions":[],"pairings":{"f:049":{"alternatives":["pair:c30d1ce97e7804af697ac596","pair:ecf36c25e6141d0996fe38c3","pair:043a126fb9c89a566a88457a","pair:7ff1084f9672b1efa0987606"],"evidence":[],"method":"weighted-lexical-overlap","reason":"Fewer than three distinct source words overlap.","review_state":"unreviewed","source_associations":[],"state":"unavailable","target":null,"targets":[]}},"pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","release_id":"openai-math","schema":"statement-map-web/2","source_roles":{"boundary":"The challenge states the task. Solution sources and reported checks are separate; a challenge placeholder is not a proof verdict.","configuration":{"detail":{"path":"lean/8a2cca85bacb1364214743d1.json","pointer":"/row/comparator"},"source":{"file":"lean/ComparatorChallenges/CommutingDerivations.json","line":null,"pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","sha256":"sha256:627ee35337cc015e1afa71282d815b9acb0f9facc91b8e15b59e3f1a25be6bb7","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/lean/ComparatorChallenges/CommutingDerivations.json"},"state":"available"},"reported_runs":{"path":"lean/8a2cca85bacb1364214743d1.json","pointer":"/reader/runs"},"solution_entry":{"detail":{"path":"lean/8a2cca85bacb1364214743d1.json","pointer":"/row/comparator"},"source":{"file":"lean/OAI/AlgebraicGeometry/CommutingDerivations/OrdinaryExtraMain.lean","line":null,"pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","sha256":"sha256:53ae01d28d16291aa58c5c7b99c6506385e7881d833f8bf74bc87be56c091f1c","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/lean/OAI/AlgebraicGeometry/CommutingDerivations/OrdinaryExtraMain.lean"},"state":"available"},"solutions":[{"detail